1
00:00:00,150 --> 00:00:02,216
Octopuses are basically ALIENS.

2
00:00:02,166 --> 00:00:04,210
Here are 5 facts that sound fake,

3
00:00:04,160 --> 00:00:05,423
but are totally real!

4
00:00:06,187 --> 00:00:06,952
Number five.

5
00:00:06,902 --> 00:00:08,027
They have THREE hearts!

6
00:00:07,977 --> 00:00:09,866
And the main one stops beating

7
00:00:09,816 --> 00:00:10,642
when they swim.

8
00:00:11,370 --> 00:00:12,019
Number four.

9
00:00:11,969 --> 00:00:13,080
Their blood is BLUE!

10
00:00:13,030 --> 00:00:14,225
It uses copper

11
00:00:14,175 --> 00:00:15,326
instead of iron.

12
00:00:16,063 --> 00:00:16,819
Number three.

13
00:00:16,769 --> 00:00:17,998
They have NINE brains!

14
00:00:17,948 --> 00:00:18,857
One big brain,

15
00:00:18,807 --> 00:00:20,675
plus a mini brain in every arm.

16
00:00:21,406 --> 00:00:22,048
Number two.

17
00:00:21,998 --> 00:00:23,457
They TASTE with their arms!

18
00:00:23,407 --> 00:00:24,620
Every sucker works

19
00:00:24,570 --> 00:00:25,584
like a tiny tongue.

20
00:00:26,333 --> 00:00:27,293
And number ONE...

21
00:00:27,243 --> 00:00:28,892
They change color in a blink.

22
00:00:28,842 --> 00:00:30,196
But scientists think

23
00:00:30,146 --> 00:00:31,370
they're COLORBLIND!

24
00:00:32,071 --> 00:00:33,695
Which fact shocked you most?

25
00:00:33,645 --> 00:00:34,397
Comment below!

26
00:00:34,347 --> 00:00:35,401
Because seriously...

